{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhuge-e-p023b","title":"诸葛亮用南中渠率不留兵运粮","accounts":[{"id":"zhuge-e-p023b-account","label":"《汉晋春秋》","text":"诸葛亮用南中渠率不留兵运粮","evidence":["zhuge-e-p023b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"用人","evidence":["zhuge-e-p023b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"南征南中时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhuge-e-p023b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-p023b-q","source_order":[35,152,"P023b"],"order":6786}],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhuge-e-p023b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-46040a6f26155eb35632","layer":"pei","quote":"南中平，皆即其渠率而用之。或以谏亮，亮曰：‘若留外人，则当留兵；兵留，则无所食。一不易也；加夷新伤破，父兄死丧；留外人而无兵者，必成祸患。二不易也；又夷累有废杀之罪，自嫌衅重；若留外人，终不相信。三不易也。今吾欲使不留兵，不运粮；而纲纪粗定，夷、汉粗安，故耳。","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a267b4d3364ab826d9c6","start":141,"end":271,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
